         MAY `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder serves a written demand for the statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders`
         WITHIN (`s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` `the day the notice was given under subsection (1)` 1 Months)
         HENCE (PARTY company
                MUST `s 215(2) the transferor company supplies the statement and posts it to the dissenting shareholder`
