-- TIMELINE: unit=calendar day; day 0=the day of the transfer that takes the transferee's holding to 90%; counting="within one month from the date of the transfer" for the transferee's notice (the last day is the transfer day plus one month, from the DATE input of the transfer day); the holder's requirement runs "within 3 months from the giving of the notice to such holder", chained by HENCE from the day the notice is given (a DATE input that must equal the trace day of the notice); the transferee's acquisition has no day in the text (silent)
