    IF (`s 215(3)(a) the transferee must give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` ((`s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` counts `the 90% is measured against a class of the shares and not against the total number of the shares`) EQUALS JUST TRUE) `the transferee has already complied with this requirement on a previous transfer pursuant to the scheme or contract`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
