         HENCE (IF `the holder is a holder of the remaining shares who has not assented to the scheme or contract`
                THEN (PARTY holder
                      MAY `s 215(3)(b) the holder requires the transferee to acquire the shares in question`
                      WITHIN (`s 215 chain: the days from the event to the last day of a period after it` `the day the transferee gave the notice to the holder` 3 Months)
                      HENCE (PARTY transferee
